{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00042","headline":"赋尚书 · 太宗皇帝","name":"赋尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崇文时驻步，东观还停辇。\n辍膳翫三坟，晖灯披五典。\n寒心覩肉林，飞魄看沈湎。\n纵情昏主多，克己明君鲜。\n灭身资累恶，成名由积善。\n既承百王末，战兢随岁转。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}